        - !<reference> 30763d43-261d-48c7-aa76-2b18251f243d
      exampleInfo: !<string[]>
        - "Build a rocket: pick a nose cone, body and fins from the parts list, choose a flight path and launch. You can also grab the planet, satellite and meteor."
        - "UI Kit layouts and components: menus, grids, a carousel, a text area, a modal, a video player, a card deck and a chat. Scroll the lists and press the buttons."
        - "Interaction Kit patterns: grab and move objects, grab the sphere to pilot the spaceship across the galaxy and push the particles along its path, and toggle one- and two-handed scale and rotate modes."
